  "body": "Per spec it appears that inline module scripts are never instantiated.\r\n\r\nUnlike cases with a src=\"\" attribute, which call \"fetch a module script graph\", inline module scripts only end up calling \"create a module script\" + \"fetch the descendants\". The next time we see it is in \"run a module script\", which asserts that the instantiation state is either \"errored\" or \"instantiated\".\r\n\r\nIt appears some portion of the \"internal module script graph fetching procedure\" should be factored out so it can be reused for inline module scripts too.\r\n\r\nI'd like to work on this after https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2543 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2542 are settled to avoid any merge conflicts.\r\n\r\n/cc @nyaxt",
